From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 11:15:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: connac: bound the scan IEs in mt76_connac_mcu_hw_scan()

Upstream: https://github.com/openwrt/mt76/commit/2e14ffbb253a56711aae45daf369ffb17bc56f66
Fixes: fcdfc29e58ee ("mt76: mt7615: introduce hw scan support")
Signed-off-by: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>

diff --git a/mt76_connac_mcu.c b/mt76_connac_mcu.c
index 8bdb138..036866a 100644
--- a/mt76_connac_mcu.c
+++ b/mt76_connac_mcu.c
@@ -1822,6 +1822,10 @@ int mt76_connac_mcu_hw_scan(struct mt76_phy *phy, struct ieee80211_vif *vif,
 	if (test_bit(MT76_HW_SCANNING, &phy->state))
 		return -EBUSY;
 
+	/* max_scan_ie_len does not cover the per-band IEs of all bands */
+	if (sreq->ie_len > sizeof(req->ies))
+		return -EINVAL;
+
 	skb = mt76_mcu_msg_alloc(mdev, NULL, sizeof(*req));
 	if (!skb)
 		return -ENOMEM;
